@CharliesSneakersPOS.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5274
@cashSessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Abrir caja (HU-09)
POST {{CharliesSneakersPOS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cash-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "openingAmount": 50000 }

### Caja abierta actual
GET {{CharliesSneakersPOS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cash-sessions/current
Accept: application/json

### Consultar sesion por id
GET {{CharliesSneakersPOS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cash-sessions/{{cashSessionId}}
Accept: application/json

### Cerrar caja (HU-10)
POST {{CharliesSneakersPOS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cash-sessions/{{cashSessionId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json

{ "countedAmount": 80000 }

### Totales en vivo sin persistir (HU-03 / HU-05)
@productVariantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{CharliesSneakersPOS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sales/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productVariantId": "{{productVariantId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "payments": [ { "method": "Cash", "amount": 20000 } ]
}
